Remove a host route of this worktree: its route file, then its entry in the
registration. Needs a registered worktree: run `treerig up` first. `treerig
route ls` lists the names.

Usage:
  treerig route rm <name> [flags]

Flags:
      --config string   path to treerig.toml (default: nearest above cwd)
  -h, --help            help for rm

Global Flags:
      --progress mode   how to show progress: auto (redraw on a terminal) or
                        plain (one line per change) (default "auto")
  -v, --verbose         show what treerig runs, and every detail
